      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-04-30/102439560.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-04-30/102439560.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 02:57:40 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>【市场动态】Alphabet第一季度营收和利润均超预期 受云业务强劲表现提振</title><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;谷歌母公司Alphabet第一季度营收和利润均超预期，主要得益于云业务强劲增长，表明这家互联网巨头在人工智能(AI)基础设施的空前投资开始获得回报&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;dl class=&quot;media_pic&quot;&gt;
     &lt;dt&gt;&lt;img data-src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2021-10-27/163532195669022_840_560.jpg&quot; class=&quot;cx-img-loader&quot; src=&quot;https://img.caixin.com/2021-10-27/163532195669022_840_560.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
