      </description><link>https://database.caixin.com/2026-04-29/102439165.html</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://database.caixin.com/2026-04-29/102439165.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 08:06:13 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>